deo class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101670/extras/43a895138395718ef77faffd0d2f26b6.poster.avif?t=1693387270\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101670/extras/43a895138395718ef77faffd0d2f26b6.webm?t=1693387270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101670/extras/43a895138395718ef77faffd0d2f26b6.mp4?t=1693387270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>We are proofread by two wonderful persons: RKS Consulting about racism and xenophobia, and Johanne concerning LGBTQIA+ subjects.",
